610
00:32:44,396 --> 00:32:45,397
No!

611
00:32:45,397 --> 00:32:46,432
Bye-bye.

612
00:32:46,432 --> 00:32:49,435
Very nice, wiley.
You're almost home free.

613
00:32:52,838 --> 00:32:55,574
